                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "496d3e87-06e6-4476-b76f-6178dd87ed42",
                                                "sense_id": "45996dcd-b985-3c2a-9a16-619b6da04586",
                                                "text": "Now that the season has arrived in many parts of the country for the nimrods to load their trusty Thirty-Thirties and go forth in quest of the elusive deer, it seems an appropriate time to say a word about the skilleting of venison — which can be a pretty tough and dry proposition if not properly handled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09ffe6d8-7fe3-4ccc-ba54-8f16798ec50f",
                                                "sense_id": "45996dcd-b985-3c2a-9a16-619b6da04586",
                                                "text": "That said, Danton in manhood is probed and skilleted, admired and reviled in a multitude of memoirs written by contemporaries who love him, loathe him or simply stand and watch as the Danton tempest roars past."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
